  "limitations": [
    "First unit-before had two failures, including one incorrect expectation that a superseded initial non-abort error should reject the next caller; only cross-request race failure proves the defect. Corrected tests retain original caller error.",
    "Original probe SHA 1c6581d9df9c4d4bd36072efe87a2d7983693fdb10c7e9df66bd5dbc1b2c88df exactly restored; stop-events and final body capture versions archived separately.",
    "Initial after-runs covers 2–5 only and does not capture success stderr. after-1 actual direct invocation exists but has no wrapper argv receipt. These remain preliminary diagnostics.",
    "after-v2 was not a frozen script sampling window and is excluded from formal acceptance; final-runs alone provides five argv/stdout/stderr/script+source-bound runs.",
    "Mac remains locked; native focus, drag and IME remain blocked_environment."
  ]
